      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Ah, this sounds a lot like Rec Room's Cheer system, they have like 5 different badges you can get next to your username if you get enough cheers sent your way! (they decay over time)\nGood, Helpful, Sportsmanlike, Creative and Good Host.\nOf course VRChat wouldn't need that many, but could be a neat little thing.",
