      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a bad idea. We've seen how the Reddit project went. Karma does nothing to promote quality. Plus, If the number shows to people, it will create a hierarchy. This creates an imbalance in the social experience. Adding a discrete measurement trivializes the social experience and puts a value to actions, which devalues the nuance that makes socialization fun.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
