  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "**Suggestion**\nAdd a system which lets players commend or endorse each other in some way, to celebrate or encourage positive interactions between players.\n**Example**\nWow, that person was really fun to talk to! You're not sure you want to send them a friend request, but they're cool.\nYou press a button, and whoosh! That person sees a green icon on their screen, and a number goes up. They feel great, thank you, and do the same! Both of you are happy about having a positive interaction.\n**Why?**\nMost people are nice. Giving players more opportunities to be nice to each other is likely to encourage friendlier interaction between them.\n\nThis would be similar to a 'Likes' system. Maybe call them headpats instead?",
